            "line": 144,
            "text": "theorem velocity_two (H K : Profile) (t : ℝ) (x : Space)\n    (hH : DifferentiableAt ℝ H (profilePoint t x))\n    (hK : DifferentiableAt ℝ K (profilePoint t x)) :\n    velocity H K (t, x) 2 =\n      H (profilePoint t x) + radialEnergy x * partialS H (profilePoint t x)"
          }
